Subject: [benchmark fixture] Isolate updater state in coaching geometry test

The version pill reads process-global updater state. A concurrent Restart
state adds about 50 pixels to the pill and moves a centered tab about 25
pixels, independently of coaching or animation settlement. Participate in
the existing updater test mutex rather than serializing the whole suite.
Keep every original hint assertion. Add a state-restoring deterministic
proof that updater actions are an independent header-width input.

